# Compose Rules
- Healthchecks for all services; fail fast if any gate fails.
- Use `host.docker.internal:1234/v1` for LM Studio from containers.

# Init DB (pgvector)
- Mount `docker/initdb/` to Postgres; `002_pgvector.sql` must exist.
